WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Soft instrumental music]
Chilika. A little closer to the water.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.200
Mangalajodi: a narrow water channel passes between tall reeds.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.400
Chilika: the blue bow of a boat moves across open water.

00:19.200 --> 00:32.400
Near sunset, a boat returns behind a row of moored boats.

00:32.400 --> 00:42.400
Utkal Project. Rediscover Utkal. Reimagine Odisha.
